<title>RUSSIA: TABLE-Russia sets 15.58 pct interest on OFZ bond.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Russia sets 15.58 pct interest on OFZ bond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry set an interest rate of 15.58 percent annual to be paid in the next quarterly coupon on October 22 on the two-year series 24009 OFZ interest-bearing government bonds maturing October 1998, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>		    fourth coupon	   third coupon</p>
<p> pct rate	  15.58		     30.39</p>
<p> rouble terms    38,843		    75,518</p>
<p> payment date    October 22		July 23</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
